This is educational software for a personal NSE paper-trading lab.
It is not financial advice, not a brokerage, and not a promise that the
book will beat Nifty, Sensex, or mutual funds by ten percentage points.
That figure is a measured target on the desk.

Live exchange orders stay compile-time off until a written strategy spec,
broker principal path, Algo-ID tagging, static IP for order endpoints,
an order-rate cap under the exchange threshold, a human kill switch, and
this disclosure are all in place.
